{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/9987", "id": 924938706, "node_id": "PR_kwDOAEfiCM43IXHS", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/9987", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/9987.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/9987.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/9987", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/9987/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/9987/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/9987/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/statuses/be50f1f2cc4874d3403eeb2c4c78cc33aa163c01", "number": 9987, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Fixed test order dependencies in class `PojoUtilsTest`", "user": {"login": "kaiyaok2", "id": 47203510, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MjAzNTEw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47203510?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2", "html_url": "https://github.com/kaiyaok2", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## What is the purpose of the change\r\nIn `dubbo-common`, several test cases in `PojoUtilsTest.java` can trigger `java.lang.IllegalArgumentException`  when being run after running tests in `SerializeClassCheckerTest.java`. \r\nFor example, if we run the following command:\r\n```\r\no=reversealphabetical; mvn test -Dsurefire.runOrder=$o -Dtest=org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.PojoUtilsTest#testArrayToCollection,SerializeClassCheckerTest#testBlockAll\r\n```\r\nWe get the following error:\r\n```\r\n[ERROR] org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.PojoUtilsTest.testArrayToCollection  Time elapsed: 0.61 s  <<< ERROR!\r\njava.lang.IllegalArgumentException: Trigger the safety barrier! Catch not allowed serialize class. Class name: org.apache.dubbo.common.model.person . This means currently maybe being attacking by others.If you are sure this is a mistake, please add this class name to `dubbo.security.serialize.allowedClassList` as a system environment property.\r\n        at org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.PojoUtilsTest.testArrayToCollection(PojoUtilsTest.java:230)\r\n```\r\nThe reason for such dependency is that tests in `SerializeClassCheckerTest.java`, specifically `testBlockAll()`, disables deserialization of all classes except for `LinkedList`. Therefore, in the example above, `realize()` will trigger the exception as deserialization of the class `Person` has been blocked if we run `SerializeClassCheckerTest.testBlockAll()` before it.\r\nThe test dependency shall be fixed as unit tests shall run successfully in any order.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Brief changelog\r\nAdd an `@AfterAll` routine in `SerializeClassCheckerTest.java` to properly clean up the changes in the test class. \r\n\r\n## Verifying this change\r\nAll tests still pass in the default order. Also, the order dependency has been removed. This can be verified by running \r\n```\r\no=reversealphabetical; mvn test -Dsurefire.runOrder=$o -Dtest=org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.PojoUtilsTest#TEST1,SerializeClassCheckerTest#TEST2\r\n```\r\nwhere TEST1 and TEST2 are arbitray tests in the corresponding test cases.", "labels": [], "milestone": {"id": 7953575, "node_id": "MI_kwDOAEfiCM4AeVyn", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/milestones/52", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/milestone/52", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/milestones/52/labels", "number": 52, "state": "closed", "title": "3.0.9", "description": "", "creator": {"login": "chickenlj", "id": 18097545, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDk3NTQ1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18097545?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj", "html_url": "https://github.com/chickenlj", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "open_issues": 0, "closed_issues": 63, "created_at": "2022-05-07T08:07:25Z", "updated_at": "2022-06-20T09:02:49Z", "closed_at": "2022-06-20T09:02:49Z", "due_on": "2022-05-31T00:00:00Z"}, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2022-05-01T14:12:45Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-01T13:31:01Z", "closed_at": "2022-06-12T14:44:32Z", "merged_at": "2022-06-12T14:44:32Z", "merge_commit_sha": "ca811c442d043177b92f023294ee5969c2a95a8a", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "kaiyaok2:3.0", "ref": "3.0", "repo": null, "sha": "be50f1f2cc4874d3403eeb2c4c78cc33aa163c01", "user": {"lo